### command after an unconditional exit
prepare
compile
exit 0
publish
>>> SC2317 4:1

### command after calling a function that always exits
die() { echo "fatal: $*" >&2; exit 1; }
prepare
compile
die "broken build"
publish
>>> SC2317 5:1

### only the outermost unreachable construct is reported
exit 1
if true; then
  echo "never"
fi
>>> SC2317 2:1

### conditional exit
prepare
compile || exit 1
publish
>>> none
